You need to #define STUPID_CPP in config.h, which makes it do more
things with functions rather than macros.  A bit less efficient,
but 1.4 MIPS isn't bad for a 5-year-old machine, so it shouldn't go
too slowly.  Also, you DO need patch 6 - the archive is about 1.5 MB
tar/compress/uuencoded for the complete source, and is probably
easier than patches.
